# Plugin version bump

Any change to the Obsidian plugin that will land on `main`, and any plugin release, must increment the version **in the same PR**.

- Bump `plugin/manifest.json` `version` (patch for fixes, minor for features).
- Add the new key to `plugin/versions.json`.
- Run `make plugin-manifest` so root `manifest.json`, `versions.json`, and `internal/web/static/assets/obsidian/` stay identical.
- Match `plugin/package.json`, the lockfile, and `cmd/syncidian` `version`.
- Git tags must equal that version with **no `v` prefix** (example: `0.1.2`).

Do not merge plugin code with an unchanged version. Docs-only or server-only changes skip this bump.
